OldSettings is derived from The OldOS Project by Zane Kleinberg (@zzanehip),
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Original project: https://github.com/zzanehip/The-OldOS-Project

Changes made for OldSettings (standalone app, saved values, working device
features, full-screen adaptation) are described in README.md and EXTRACTION.json.

Bundled resources from The OldOS Project: the Settings artwork, the 27 wallpapers
(re-encoded as JPEG) and the app icon (Homescreen Icons/Settings, upscaled,
Dark/Tinted derived). The ringtone previews are the original synthesised tones of OldClock.
